# GOVERNANCE

The law of the fixture repo. The checker parses the tag vocabulary
below, so this file is the single source for legal tags.

## Tag vocabulary

- `eos` for everything
- `wargame` for wargames
- `web` for web material

## Protected set

Nothing in the fixture is protected.
